Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:48.40,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,相當有感覺　無敵的POWER！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:51.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,真的感覺不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.81,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.19,0:00:58.41,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,來　向著明天前進吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:12.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,只要接觸就能了解　心的極限
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:15.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:19.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes! Change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.75,0:01:22.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,激烈的戰鬥　不管多少次都要嘗試！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:26.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,貫徹真實
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:29.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:32.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,驚險刺激最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.55,0:01:40.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣開始照亮世界的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.01,0:01:45.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,充滿你給予的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:52.81,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,將不似任何人的笑容作為榮耀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:57.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,現在超越未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:02:01.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,We can try over the future world!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.89,0:02:02.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:03.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,最大 !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:07.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,大膽 !
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:24.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算隱瞞也是沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:29.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是什麼我都全部知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.68,0:22:35.17,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這並非不可思議　因為　我是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:40.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,愛著你的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.12,0:22:45.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來　朝向這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.79,0:22:50.09,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的　love×love<親親密密地>　被綁在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.09,0:22:52.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是絕對的！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.30,0:22:57.02,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直　永遠不變
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:03.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在珠穆朗瑪峰　向世界進行　絕對宣言！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.65,0:23:08.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之　接受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.48,0:23:12.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,2人　love×love<親親密密地>　被綁在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:15.10,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是絕對的！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:19.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是　希望大吉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.84,0:23:23.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在聖·伯多祿　發誓　愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.94,0:23:26.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對宣言！！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.57,0:00:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上了——！…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:32.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再不快點的話  要遲到了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.71,0:00:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經不會再將她們看成大人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部的催眠已經解開了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.43,0:02:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(660,570)\fad(500,500)}10th sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.43,0:02:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(760,600)\fad(500,500)}「釜底游魚！趕緊啊  B.A.B.E.L.2！！」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  再不快點就要遲到了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.62,0:02:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.98,0:02:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像在用手機跟誰說話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.46,0:02:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家  要求緊急出動
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這次的任務是從與油輪相撞而沉沒的漁船
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.08,0:02:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「波風丸」裡將受困者救出來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留在船內的船員有六人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外還有在救援工作中被捲入沉沒中的兩名潛水員
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本部預知課沒有在事前預知事故嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事故的發生是預知到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.53,0:02:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是海上保安廳的聯絡卻遲了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說沒有趕上嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.52,0:02:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會連船一起運到海上來的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不  還是讓我把船員們傳送出來比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是行不通的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在用念力讓它上浮的期間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs20\pos(562,660)}Psychokinesis
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無法保證在事故中破損的波風丸船體能夠承受得了水壓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.12,0:03:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就要用瞬移
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:19.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波風丸在海底
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到海上的救難船那麼遠距離的瞬移風險太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.38,0:03:26.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.65,0:03:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了嗎  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:33.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們B.A.B.E.L.有為了這種時候的裝備
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.49,0:03:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊  已經完成了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:38.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  你們用B.A.B.E.L.2前往現場
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.21,0:03:44.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L.1 3 4 5 27
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L.2！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  是最新型的特殊潛水艇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  特殊潛水艇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是像特攝劇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:03:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該更像動畫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上準備出動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裝束  不管怎麼看肌膚的裸露也太少了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不不不不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要露啊  又不是去海水浴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太冷了  不要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼至少…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:33.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裝上貓耳和尾巴嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不需要那種東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點換好衣服出動啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,色狼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之給我快點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.10,0:04:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Children出動
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成登艦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始往槽內注水
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.65,0:05:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注水完成
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.97,0:05:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開放閘門
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收納連接橋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啟動引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:55.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啟動引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:05:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始潛水
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脫離船塢  潛行  LV4
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L.2  維持規定速度
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從路線7轉向路線5
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自動行駛系統  正常
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噪音等級  安定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到達主閘門
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在開始進入東京灣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最大潛速
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最大出力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.67,0:06:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開啟Over Driver
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害  這就是特殊潛水艇嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.37,0:06:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}Wonderworld{\r}\N就像仙境一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是CG的勝利啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對於這種東西感到新奇  她們果然還幼稚著啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.18,0:07:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到什麼不得了的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼  沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.38,0:07:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先確認一下作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一到達現場  紫穗你就去確認漁船內的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.41,0:07:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後葵  你帶著我和薰移動到漁船內
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.69,0:07:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰則要制止因為水壓可能造成的漁船崩塌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這期間  葵將乘員和潛水員移動到B.A.B.E.L 2
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.27,0:07:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後只要我們回來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼作戰就結束了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前方有異
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發現波風丸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓B.A.B.E.L.2靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Children  解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:01.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在廣闊大海的彼方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:04.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼在等待著我們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是希望之星還是絕望呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借助奧金之力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃  沒有人在看的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要站在桌子上  還有不要放煙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船尾  向船底靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,展開機械手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,機械手  操作正常
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.79,0:08:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生存者  確認
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:36.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.11,0:08:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚇我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要吃驚的可不是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和紫穗說的一樣  根本不是八個人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,粗看一下  有二十  不  有三十人之多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  為什麼會有這麼多人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為有偷渡客躲在船艙裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.27,0:09:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是在救援工作時被捲入沉沒中的潛水員吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船體快撐不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  念動完全防護罩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話  船暫時就沒問題了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:34.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵  很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連續瞬移
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.71,0:10:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要和我說話  會分心的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.21,0:10:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  不要碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.81,0:10:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要狡辯了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.89,0:10:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是最後一個了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.99,0:10:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再多了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不著這麼擔心  就像你們看到的一樣  輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.48,0:10:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休息一會後  我們也回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.79,0:10:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽得到嗎  皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L.2完全超載了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.49,0:10:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了確保上浮的推動力  最多只能再坐一個小孩了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.78,0:10:48.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:10:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  我是操作人員
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:10:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(640,652)}へ　私はオペレーターです
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(640,652)}すばらしい　やまべのクラス
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山部老師的美好班級
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.70,0:11:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明石的布丁我收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.76,0:11:09.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野君真喜歡布丁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:11.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布丁對身體有益的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.11,0:11:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們三人總是一起請假啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裡面包含維他命  焦糖  糖分  乳脂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們不是屬於家族間的交往嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三人一起出去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.38,0:11:24.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好  竟然可以向學校請假出去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波風丸乘員的救援工作現在由海上保安廳在B.A.B.E.L的協助下…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把野上同學和三宮同學布丁也吃掉沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野君你真喜歡布丁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布丁對身體…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:45.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  這裡好冷  而且魚腥味好重
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等B.A.B.E.L.2放下救出的人回來就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且為什麼要我留下來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也明白的吧  在那種情況下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.79,0:12:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓葵將自己瞬移到B.A.B.E.L.2是最好的選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且  沒有你的防護罩的話  波風丸會被壓塌的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:10.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是好冷啊  魚腥味好重  受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忍耐一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.24,0:12:14.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是個小鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事  剛才這感覺…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難…難道…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.16,0:12:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又來了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你剛才說了小鬼二字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.97,0:12:29.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部的催眠不是已經解除了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.82,0:12:36.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作為懲罰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.99,0:12:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫我取暖～
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.97,0:12:46.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別過來  要保持清醒  即使我說行你也別靠近我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.26,0:12:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  我冷得受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫我取暖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要叫人了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會有人來的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:06.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是挺好的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再靠近我的話我就咬舌自盡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:14.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是少女嗎  又不是情竇初開的年紀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反倒是你  這不是你該說的話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真沒辦法  沒出息的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是沒出息  最近的男人可真沒用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.33,0:13:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之給我上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.87,0:13:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  這有點不好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫且這樣就好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.99,0:13:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  吃醋了？  那麼為什麼要施加那種催眠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.39,0:13:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介果然是變態
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在那小子把女王當作女性了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卻沒有察覺這是致命的失誤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,致命的失誤？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:03.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.27,0:14:06.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這正是我所希望的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.73,0:14:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家人家的問題啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又不是人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.01,0:14:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我閉嘴看著  你這齧齒類
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海上保安廳傳來救出人員的移送已經完成的報告
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.89,0:14:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L.2請去救援在波風丸號裡的兩人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.26,0:14:20.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:24.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度不能再快一點嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是最大速度了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在海裡兩人獨處  太危險了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.69,0:14:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我們去救他們的時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看見兩人突然分開的話就不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.87,0:14:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且在那之後  如果小薰要是有了什麼成熟的韻味的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.81,0:14:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要擔心  我們什麼都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩人還通過眼神交流
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.73,0:14:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩人還悄悄地勾手指
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太差勁了  在大海中的船裡做出如此齷齪的事情的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.81,0:15:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們可不想今後都在這種隊伍裡做配角
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  身體凍得跟冰塊一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這聲音是…兵部！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她並不是想要耍你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:24.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為她在這冰冷的海底
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了張開抵抗水壓的防護罩  而不斷地放出能量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.82,0:15:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到你卻被她的樣子所迷惑  連這點小事都沒察覺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道  這就是你的目的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.34,0:15:47.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別說的這麼難聽  這事故是偶然
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.14,0:15:55.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對你施加的催眠是加了暗示的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暗示？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:15:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將使得催眠再度出現的暗語
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,定為你絕對會說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:05.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對會說的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是個小鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼…嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以薰的樣子才會…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.25,0:16:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然把我的女王叫作小鬼  失禮也要有個限度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是對你的懲罰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帶你們到上面去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你對我說一句「拜託了」就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帶著罪惡感  敗北感  還有無力感
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.53,0:16:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屈服於我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.39,0:16:55.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話  就能夠對你施加更為強力的催眠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.72,0:17:05.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰…薰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.57,0:17:16.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要碰薰！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我操縱血液調整了體溫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.63,0:17:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是做不到這種事的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介  還沒好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.35,0:17:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來  快點上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.95,0:17:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要說一句話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你說一句「拜託了」就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.39,0:18:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜…拜託…了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種話  你以為我會對你說嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣讓我屈服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使得能夠對我施加半永久性的催眠才是你的目的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.09,0:18:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  居然察覺到了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好歹也算是一名超能力研究者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,催眠能力Hypno是對方的內心越脆弱就越容易施加的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是打算最終將我變成你操縱的人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把Children變成隨你所願的道具吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕不會對你這樣的傢伙屈服的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時間到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.28,0:18:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.45,0:18:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他沒有做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ESP手銬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.39,0:19:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我一起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:06.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.73,0:19:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你以為憑這種東西就能贏我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵  快點…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被他跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能  居然從這ESP手銬…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還給你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還我？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.80,0:19:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:33.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有好好洗過熨過的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  可惡  可惡  可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.30,0:19:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.44,0:19:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.49,0:19:53.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.31,0:19:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.89,0:19:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變回小鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小鬼真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要叫我小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恢復通信
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平…平安完成任務了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:24.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子們呢  孩子們沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.56,0:20:26.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就晾一邊去吧  快讓我看看孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攝影機切換  Flashout
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.81,0:20:30.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.27,0:20:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才說的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那傢伙做了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.05,0:20:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  他是絕對不會加害於你和超能力者的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.31,0:20:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是比我預想的還要有趣的玩具啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天光是知道這麼多就已經算是有收穫了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.81,0:21:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介  我肚子餓了  回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連深層心理測試都做了  完全沒有異常
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:10.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次真的完全沒問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎  謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就算告一段落了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:17.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是災難啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:18.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一點在意的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.35,0:21:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的催眠  沒有留下任何痕跡就消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.59,0:21:25.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直就像…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是由兵部自己將它消去一般
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是由兵部自己？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.43,0:21:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  那個人的話明明可以做到讓催眠一直持續的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.97,0:21:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生他？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒騙你的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說著「小鬼真是太好了」而喜形於色？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.82,0:21:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還難得地緊緊抱住我們
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.88,0:21:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是好像是發自內心感到喜悅
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧～
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.24,0:21:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貨真價實的…Loli控！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  說曹操曹操到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Loli…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…控
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.14,0:22:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不…不是的——！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.03,0:23:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.29,0:23:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,決定舉行特殊超能力者慰安旅行 In 深山
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.78,0:23:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊超能力者慰安旅行？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.61,0:23:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是日本的LV7 The Children  不過是小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.83,0:23:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說溫泉可以同時洗澡和游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.95,0:23:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1 Stop 2 Bump
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.66,0:23:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.07,0:24:01.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第11話  「露天溫泉！在霧氣中閃光的眼」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.25,0:24:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回有很多限制級和殺必死鏡頭
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.61,0:24:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是大叔啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.46,0:24:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

